{"branch":"호평점","html":"<section id=\"selected-directions\" class=\"km-directions\" aria-labelledby=\"selected-directions-title\" data-km-branch=\"호평점\"><h3 id=\"selected-directions-title\">찾아오시는 길</h3><p class=\"km-intro\">호평점의 위치와 주변 교통편을 확인하세요.</p><div class=\"km-map\" data-state=\"waiting\"><iframe data-km-src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/maps/39t8h2ws4ee.htm\" title=\"호평점 카카오 지도\" width=\"800\" height=\"398\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe><p class=\"km-map-status\">카카오 지도</p></div><div class=\"km-details\"><dl><dt>주소</dt><dd>경기 남양주시 늘을3로 65-6 테마프라자 205호</dd></dl><section class=\"km-transit\"><h4>주변 지하철</h4><ul><li><span class=\"km-line\">경춘선</span>평내호평역</li></ul></section><section class=\"km-transit\"><h4>주변 정류장</h4><ul><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">1</span>호만마을.호평중흥아파트</li><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">2</span>호만마을.호평중흥아파트</li><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">3</span>호평동.대주신명아파트</li><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">4</span>호평동.대주신명아파트</li></ul></section><section class=\"km-transit\"><h4>주변 버스</h4><ul class=\"km-buses\"><li><span class=\"km-bus-kind\" data-type=\"0103\">광역</span><span class=\"km-route-names\"><span>M2323</span><span>M2323(예약)</span></span></li><li><span class=\"km-bus-kind\" data-type=\"0106\">일반</span><span class=\"km-route-names\"><span>165</span><span>93</span><span>97</span></span></li><li><span class=\"km-bus-kind\" data-type=\"0110\">직행</span><span class=\"km-route-names\"><span>1000</span><span>1100</span></span></li></ul></section><p class=\"km-traffic-note\">주변 교통 정보는 제공된 카카오맵 약도 기준입니다. 노선과 정차 여부는 운행 상황에 따라 달라질 수 있습니다.</p></div></section>"}